        <h2>Help with <em>every step</em> of downsizing your home</h2>
        <p class="rx-sub">Downsizing after many years in one home is rarely just a logistics problem. Chayce gives you one dedicated coordinator for all of it, so you are not managing several companies at once.</p>
        <ul class="rx-points"><li><i class="fas fa-clipboard-list" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Sort and declutter</h3><p>Room by room, at your pace: decades of belongings and decisions about what fits a smaller space. We also stage the property for viewings.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-box-open" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Packed with care</h3><p>Room by room, every box labelled by destination room, with medication and important papers kept accessible.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-truck" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>A fully insured removal</h3><p>Insured against loss or damage in transit, with the cover set out in your service agreement before the move begins.</p></li><li><i class="fas fa-handshake" aria-hidden="true"></i><h3>Sale, solicitor and settling in</h3><p>Your coordinator liaises with your estate agent and solicitor (Gold Prestige adds full solicitor coordination), transfers utilities, cleans the vacated home and unpacks and sets up the new one.</p></li></ul>
        <p class="rx-where">We are based in Northampton and help older people downsize across the whole UK, whether you are moving to a bungalow, a retirement village, a smaller family home or closer to your children. What is included depends on the package you choose.</p>
