    <ol class="rx-line" style="--n:4"><li><span class="gd-num">1</span><h3>Plan it</h3><p>A Discovery Consultation, from &pound;{{ (site.packages | findByKey("discovery")).price | gbp }}, gives you a personalised plan, timeline and budget in an hour, before you commit to anything.</p></li><li><span class="gd-num">2</span><h3>Sort and stage</h3><p>Room by room sorting and decluttering, and staging if you are selling.</p></li><li><span class="gd-num">3</span><h3>Pack and move</h3><p>Careful packing, then a fully insured removal on the day.</p></li><li><span class="gd-num">4</span><h3>Settle in</h3><p>Unpacking and set-up at the new home, plus utilities and a clean of the old one, depending on your package.</p></li></ol>
    <p class="rx-cap">Most people benefit from starting three to six months before their target date, though we can work to shorter timescales.</p>
